  <div>
    <h2>Our story</h2>
    <p>Before it was a campsite, Clairac was a wine estate. You can still feel it today: a few rows of vines remain in the grounds, the tall trees have had time to grow, and the old house watches over it all.</p>
    <p>We never wanted to turn this place into a leisure park. We simply opened 25 pitches in this setting and left the rest in peace.</p>
  </div>
