    <h2>The estate</h2>
    <p>The estate has large, shady pitches, sheltered by trees that are sometimes centuries old: pines, olive trees and oleanders. Wildlife roams freely, between wooded areas and more open spaces, in a calm setting that invites you to rest.</p>
